    {
      "text": "白天建设经济与防线，夜晚亲自迎击不死军团",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Build by day, fight by night—defend your home with wit and blade! By day, you need to construct and upgrade 30 different buildings and units, allocate resources to develop your economy, and deploy soldiers to build an impenetrable defense line.",
