      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "六把武器各带专属技能和30项天赋，再叠加Rogue增益塑造流派",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The game offers 6 unique weapons, each with distinct skills and 30 upgradable talents. Defeating enemies in battle grants Rogue boons, allowing you to freely combine and create your own combat style.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3648260/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "九张递增难度地图迎战40类怪物，并在终夜对决地图Boss",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "At night, 40 different types of monsters will emerge, launching frenzied attacks. On the final night, the map's ultimate boss will personally descend—prepare for an epic showdown! 9 distinct maps, each with rising difficulty, will test your tactics and decisions.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3648260/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
